      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "The learner needs to identify the independent (manipulated) variable before they can state a relationship. Ask a single, focused question that checks their understanding of which variable is being varied in the experiment.",
      "content": "In this investigation, which variable is being deliberately changed: the pressure of the gas or the volume of the gas? Please tell me which one you think is the independent variable."
    },
